1225 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Zoe learned that regular Universities in Germany are great for students who love research and studying in depth. These places are all about learning theories and getting deep into subjects.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (For students who prefer hands-on experience, Zoe found out about Universities of Applied Sciences. These places focus on practical learning and often have lots of internships to get students ready for jobs.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
