/ActualText (This e-book is a work of fiction and serves as a conversational guide. The characters within its pages are entirely fictional, and any resemblance to real persons, living or dead, is purely coincidental. While the conversations and scenarios are crafted from imagination, the factual information presented is accurate and has been sourced from Studying-in-Germany.org, "The Essential Guide to Studying in Germany" E-book, and insights from education experts at Studying-in-Germany.org.)
