/ActualText (The primary aim of this guide is to assist prospective students in understanding the requirements, processes, and experiences associated with studying in Germany. It does so in an engaging and innovative manner by exploring these topics through conversations between two friends. This approach is intended to make the information accessible and enjoyable, providing readers with a unique and entertaining way to gather essential knowledge about studying in Germany.)
/Pg 68 0 R
/K [1]
